{
 "_doc": "Bannerline skill + power effects (stream C, art only; the sim never reads it). js/view/skillfx.js plays these on sim events with avatar-3d/js/spellfx.js (BatchedSpellFx). Each skill id has `cast` (played on the `cast` event), optional `bolt` (the `bolt` event: element + `trail` true for a sprite trail), `zone` (on `zone` for this skill: drawn for the zone's life), `pulse` (each `pulse`), `hit` (when a `hit` carries this skill), `dash` (on `dash`). A recipe is { fx, at, element, radius?, scale?, ms?, status?, seconds? }. fx: cast | ring | pillar | vortex | storm | heal | impact | breath | footfalls | status | flare. at: caster | point (the event's x,z) | target. radius 'event' = the event's radius. Unknown skills fall back to `default.<shape>` by the skill's element. `powers` uses the same recipes on the `power` event (`land` on `powerHit`). `statuses` maps sim status ids to spellfx STATUS_FX auras drawn on the body while on.",
